    heroSubtitle: 'Zhejiang University IFRC was established by Dr. Meng Han and is jointly built and operated in collaboration with partner institutions.',
    heroDesc: 'Research focuses on large model security, multimodal & reinforcement learning, agentic & embodied AI, as well as AI copyright & trustworthy governance, dedicated to building secure, trustworthy, and efficient AI systems.',
    heroPi: 'Director: Dr. Meng Han',
    heroCta: 'Learn More',
    aboutTitle: 'About Us',
    aboutContent: "<div class=\"about-layout\"><header class=\"about-lead\"><div class=\"about-lead-copy\"><p class=\"about-kicker\">From Original Intention to Future</p><p class=\"about-tagline\">Let every passion for AI find its soil for growth here.</p></div><figure class=\"about-figure\"><svg class=\"about-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"about-glow-en\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color:#58a6ff;stop-opacity:0.35\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color:#00d4ff;stop-opacity:0.15\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"320\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#111820\" stroke=\"#21262d\"/><circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"102\" r=\"52\" fill=\"url(#about-glow-en)\" stroke=\"#58a6ff\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\"/><g stroke=\"#58a6ff\" stroke-width=\"1.25\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.65\"><path d=\"M36 108 Q96 48 158 102 T292 88\"/><path d=\"M72 168 Q132 72 210 124 T304 52\"/></g><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"72\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"132\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#58a6ff\"/><circle cx=\"204\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#58a6ff\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"156\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00d4ff\"/></svg></figure></header><section class=\"about-founder-showcase\" aria-labelledby=\"about-founder-heading\"><p class=\"about-founder-lead\">Since founding DIR in North America in 2017, we have believed that vibrant research crosses boundaries and welcomes diverse voices. In 2021, the lab became IFRC under Zhejiang University with a physical home in Hangzhou High-tech Zone. <strong>What you see today is the same IFRC platform established in 2021</strong>—our people, projects, and partnerships keep growing on that foundation.</p><div class=\"about-founder-frame-outer\"><div class=\"about-founder-inner\"><div class=\"about-founder-inner-head\"><h3 id=\"about-founder-heading\" class=\"about-founder-title\">Founder's Message</h3><p class=\"about-founder-sub\">Low barriers. Real enthusiasm.</p></div><blockquote class=\"about-founder-quote\"><p>No matter where you are in the world or what stage you are at—if you are willing to bring your mind and hands to AI, this is your platform, your support, and your companions.</p></blockquote><ul class=\"about-founder-highlights\"><li><span class=\"afh-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span><strong>DIR · 2017</strong>A North American hub for open collaboration among like-minded AI researchers.</span></li><li><span class=\"afh-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span><strong>IFRC · 2021–present</strong>Under ZJU, one physical platform in Hangzhou High-tech Zone—today's lab is the continuation of that same IFRC.</span></li><li><span class=\"afh-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span><strong>Mutual commitment</strong>IFRC invests fully in every member; we hope you bring clarity, respect for time, and determination to grow together.</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"about-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"about-ifrc-title\"><h3 id=\"about-ifrc-title\" class=\"about-panel-title\">What IFRC Stands For</h3><p class=\"about-lede\">The name reflects converging lines of AI research—and richer meanings shaped together by our members:</p><ul class=\"about-pillars\"><li><span class=\"pillar-letter\" aria-hidden=\"true\">I</span><div><strong>Intelligence</strong><span>The pursuit of rigorous cognition</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pillar-letter\" aria-hidden=\"true\">F</span><div><strong>Fairness</strong><span>Technology for good, empowering industries</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pillar-letter\" aria-hidden=\"true\">R</span><div><strong>Robustness</strong><span>AI that survives real-world demands</span></div></li><li><span class=\"pillar-letter\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span><div><strong>Collaboration</strong><span>Open, equal, co-creation</span></div></li></ul><p class=\"about-note-inline\">One layer speaks to how we research; the other to how we work.</p></section><section class=\"about-panel about-panel-split\" aria-labelledby=\"about-focus-title\"><div class=\"about-split-text\"><h3 id=\"about-focus-title\" class=\"about-panel-title\">Research Focus (Summary)</h3><p class=\"about-lede\">Trustworthy AI across the lifecycle—corpus quality, robust models, fairness, privacy, interpretability—plus intent understanding, hallucination mitigation, adversarial learning, agents, and multimodal generative AI.</p><p class=\"about-jump\"><a href=\"#research\">Explore the interactive diagram →</a></p></div><div class=\"about-split-visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"about-mini-chart\"><span class=\"mini-bar b1\"></span><span class=\"mini-bar b2\"></span><span class=\"mini-bar b3\"></span><span class=\"mini-bar b4\"></span></div><p class=\"about-mini-caption\">Trust · Agents · Industry</p></div></section><section class=\"about-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"about-seek-title\"><h3 id=\"about-seek-title\" class=\"about-panel-title\">Who We Are Looking For</h3><p class=\"about-lede\">We welcome diverse backgrounds—nationality, degree path, and prior experience are not barriers:</p><ul class=\"about-checklist\"><li>Undergraduates (years 2–4) with genuine enthusiasm for AI</li><li>Master\'s and PhD students who love deep research</li><li>Graduating students targeting research or engineering roles</li><li>Professionals or gap-year explorers returning to research</li></ul></section><section class=\"about-panel\"><h3 class=\"about-panel-title\">What You Will Gain (Summary)</h3><div class=\"about-cards\"><article class=\"about-card\"><h4>Top-tier environment</h4><p>Work with scholars from ZJU and partner universities on real problems and strong publications.</p></article><article class=\"about-card\"><h4>End-to-end practice</h4><p>Trusted data, training & alignment, agents, hallucination control, and robustness—full stack exposure.</p></article><article class=\"about-card\"><h4>Industry integration</h4><p>Partner with product teams shipping technology to hundreds of millions of users.</p></article><article class=\"about-card\"><h4>Impact</h4><p>We build useful AI—engineering that answers real operational needs.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"about-panel about-panel-muted\"><p class=\"about-lede\"><strong>Values:</strong> candor, equality, open collaboration—and mutual commitment to time well spent.</p><p class=\"about-jump\"><a href=\"mailto:recruit@zju-if.com\">recruit@zju-if.com</a></p></section></div>",
